# UI-tour balloon example. Add the matching UI nodes to the `tutorial_target`
# group for the spotlight tags below to find them.

~ start
if not GameState.has_flag("hub_ui_tour_seen"):
	set GameState.set_flag("hub_ui_tour_seen")
	set locals.steps = 3
	Guide: Your current activity appears here. [#target=QuestPanel]
	Guide: This meter shows your available energy. [#target=EnergyMeter]
	Guide: Open this button to pause or adjust settings. [#target=PauseButton]
	- Got it
		=> END

Guide: You have already completed the hub tour.
- Show the tour again
	set locals.steps = 3
	Guide: Your current activity appears here. [#target=QuestPanel]
	Guide: This meter shows your available energy. [#target=EnergyMeter]
	Guide: Open this button to pause or adjust settings. [#target=PauseButton]
	=> END
- Leave
	=> END
